*************************
* Makefiles Explanation *
*************************

WEBOTS_HOME and WK3_PORTABLE (library path) paths should be defined at
your .bashrc

Makefile at WK3_PORTABLE: does the make instruction for our library
libk3_webots.a

The relativepositionboard module makes use of GNU Scientific Library in
order to generate gaussian noise in the range and bearing values. In
order to compile libraries -lgsl -lgslcblas must be added to the
Makefile (see below) and in the case of Ubuntu  libgsl0-dev package
installed.

Makefile at our Controller Path: does the make instruction for our
controller, including our libk3_webots.a library and needed headers at
WK3_PORTABLE. This makefile should be something like this:

	C_SOURCES=your_controller.c other_code.c

	#Your library
	MY_LIBRARY=-lk3_webots

	#Include Webots Makefile
	include $(WEBOTS_HOME)/projects/default/controllers/Makefile.include

	#Include headers and libraries paths
	INCLUDE= -I "$(WK3_PORTABLE)" -I"$(WEBOTS_HOME)/include"

	LIBRARIES= -L $(WK3_PORTABLE) $(MY_LIBRARY) -lgsl -lgslcblas

Webots Makefile: not modified Makefile.

*****************************************************************
* What you can do with libk3_webots.a library and how to use it *
*****************************************************************

The code this library owns has been made trying to respect faithfully
KheperaIIIToolbox author's code and style.  So future improvement and
modifications can be made easily by anyone familiar with the toolbox.


For using this library you just need to #include <khepera3.h> in your
program.


Khepera3 module has been implemented, and it includes these submodules:
		
	KHEPERA3: defines Khepera3 structure and initialization
	functions. It includes every webots header needed for correct
	operation.  A defined control_step variable is set to 32 ms by
	default in khepera3.h, present at every sudmodule needed
	(e.g. infrared and ultrasound).

	KHEPERA3_DRIVE: you can set motors speed and differential
	speed. Also get and set current position from encoders.

	KHEPERA3_MOTOR: defines the motor structure for later use in
	khepera3_drive submodule.  No more things were implemented as
	they were useless. Main motor control is defined at
	khepera3_drive.

	KHEPERA3_INFRARED: defines khepera3_infrared_proximity()
	function and creates a numerical index of each sensor.  Does
	not define infrared_ambient().

	KHEPERA3_ULTRASOUND: defines everything previously defined in
	khepera3 toolbox and initializes each sensor structure,
	setting only the first value of their fields.  This task is
	implemented in ultrasound_structure_init().  Amplitude field
	is defined as 1 in khepera3_ultrasound.h. This functions have
        not been tested.

Odometry_track module has been implemented:

The values of WHEEL_RADIUS 0.0212, AXLE_LENGTH 0.0893,
ENCODER_RESOLUTION 440, have been added as #define to use the values
of the webots model of the Khepera III.

